eui-gpui — bundled third-party font
===================================

The `eui-gpui` crate is Exponential's own source, covered by the repository's
Apache License 2.0 (see /LICENSE at the repo root) — EXCEPT the font files
listed below.

assets/fonts/InterSymbols-{Regular,Medium,SemiBold,Bold}.ttf
------------------------------------------------------------

`Inter Symbols`: a subset of Inter (https://github.com/rsms/inter) to the key
symbols in packages/exponential-ui/fonts/inter-symbols.json, renamed, at
weights 400/500/600/700. Embedded into the crate (`src/symbol_fonts.rs`) and
registered with gpui's text system at runtime.

